<title>USA: Neiman Marcus same-store sales down.</title>
<headline>Neiman Marcus same-store sales down.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neiman Marcus Group Inc Thursday reported sales for the five and 22 week periods ended January 4.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $337.0     $327.9	+2.8	 -0.6</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $1,073.7     $996.9	+7.7	 +3.9</p>
<p>Harcourt General Inc owns about 53 percent of the outstanding common equity in Neiman Marcus Group.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
